            "review_title": "Review at Danang Gochipan",
            "review_text": "clover108\n4 contributions\n0\nlove cake\nFeb 2017 • Family\nThe bakery shop is relatively small but the cake is really delicious. I am becoming a patron of this shop, so yummy ^-^. I love cake. The moment you walk into door, the aroma of bakery filled out the room and make you enjoy immediately. Every customers is greeted in the same way in Japanese. I love the bread rotti with egg, the paparoti.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 20, 2017",
